API-16: range-check the end period, element index and attribute in the output reader

The series getters accepted an end period past the last period, the series
and result getters tested "index > count" instead of "index >= count", and no
series or attribute getter checked the attribute index, so an out-of-range
argument returned error 0 with values read from the next element, the next
block of the file, or past its end. Reject endPeriod > Nperiods (422, or 423
in SMO_getSystemSeries as for its other period errors), index >= count (423)
and an attribute outside 0 .. Vars-1 (421).

Requires: CRASH-19 (the NULL-handle lines sit next to these checks)

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply API-16_swmm530.patch

